          <a href="#intellectual-property" class="block py-1 px-2 rounded-md text-[#4A5550] hover:text-[#08110D] hover:bg-[#F8FAF8] transition">7. Intellectual Property Rights</a>
          <a href="#suspension" class="block py-1 px-2 rounded-md text-[#4A5550] hover:text-[#08110D] hover:bg-[#F8FAF8] transition">8. Account Termination & Bans</a>
