      <!-- Main Legal Terms Document -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white border border-[#E3E9E5] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs space-y-10 text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed text-sm">

        <!-- 1. Acceptance of Terms -->
        <section id="acceptance" class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">1.</span> Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            By accessing, creating an account on, or interacting with <strong>zlik</strong> (operated at <code>zlik.store</code> and its related subdomains, custom domains, mobile web apps, and API interfaces), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service (“Terms”) and our <a href="/privacy" class="text-[#087A50] font-semibold underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you do not agree to these Terms, you must immediately discontinue using our services. In these Terms, "we", "us", "our", and "zlik" refer to the platform, while "Merchant", "Seller", "User", or "You" refers to anyone creating an online storefront or utilizing our services. "Buyer" or "Customer" refers to anyone browsing or placing orders on a merchant’s storefront.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Eligibility & Account Registration -->
        <section id="eligibility" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">2.</span> Account Registration & Eligibility
          </h2>
          <p>
            To register as a merchant on zlik, you must be at least 18 years of age or possess legal business capacity in your jurisdiction. When creating an account, you agree to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5550]">
            <li>Provide accurate, truthful, and up-to-date business and personal information (Store Name, Phone/WhatsApp Number, Email).</li>
            <li>Maintain the confidentiality of your credentials and password.</li>
            <li>Promptly notify zlik of any unauthorized use or security breach of your account.</li>
            <li>Accept full responsibility for all activities occurring under your store link and credentials.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Storefronts & Prohibited Goods -->
        <section id="store-operations" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">3.</span> Storefronts & Prohibited Goods Policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            zlik provides merchants with tools to publish catalogs, process customer orders, and manage sales ledgers. However, merchants are strictly prohibited from listing, advertising, or selling any of the following items on their zlik storefront:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-red-900 space-y-2">
            <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-red-800">
              <span>🚫</span>
              <span>Strictly Prohibited Goods & Services:</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-red-800">
              <li>Illegal drugs, narcotics, controlled substances, and drug paraphernalia.</li>
              <li>Firearms, ammunition, explosives, fireworks, and dangerous weapons.</li>
              <li>Counterfeit goods, replicas, stolen property, or pirated copyrighted materials.</li>
              <li>Ponzi schemes, multi-level marketing (MLM) programs, and fraudulent financial services.</li>
              <li>Pornographic, explicit, or sexually exploitative materials.</li>
              <li>Items promoting hate speech, violence, harassment, or discrimination.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#6B756F]">
            Violation of this Prohibited Goods Policy will result in immediate termination of the store without prior notice or subscription refund.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Pricing, Subscriptions & Limits -->
        <section id="pricing-billing" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">4.</span> Pricing, Subscriptions & Limits
          </h2>
          <p>
            zlik offers tiered plans to empower businesses of all sizes:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="border border-[#E3E9E5] bg-[#F8FAF8] p-3 rounded-xl">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#08110D] font-display">Free Starter</div>
              <div class="text-base font-extrabold mt-0.5">₦0 / mo</div>
              <div class="text-[#6B756F] mt-1">10 products, 1 photo/item, 3 active debts, essential analytics.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-[#19D98B] bg-emerald-50/40 p-3 rounded-xl">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#087A50] font-display">Pro Plan</div>
              <div class="text-base font-extrabold text-[#087A50] mt-0.5">₦5,000 / mo</div>
              <div class="text-[#4A5550] mt-1">500 products, 5 photos/item, all 15 themes, unlimited debts & ledger.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-[#E3E9E5] bg-[#F8FAF8] p-3 rounded-xl">
              <div class="font-bold text-[#08110D] font-display">Business Plan</div>
              <div class="text-base font-extrabold mt-0.5">₦9,000 / mo</div>
              <div class="text-[#6B756F] mt-1">10 stores, unlimited items, custom domains, 5 staff accounts.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            Subscriptions are billed either monthly or annually in advance. Subscriptions may be cancelled at any time from your merchant settings. Unless required by applicable law, subscription fees paid are non-refundable.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Customer Orders & Payments -->
        <section id="orders-payments" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">5.</span> Customer Orders & 0% Platform Commission
          </h2>
          <p>
            <strong>0% Commission Policy:</strong> zlik does not take any percentage cut or commission on sales made between merchants and their buyers. Merchants receive 100% of order totals directly from customers through direct bank transfer, payment on delivery, or connected payment gateways.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-950">
            <strong>Direct Merchant-Buyer Relationship:</strong> zlik provides the software technology and order management infrastructure. zlik is not the seller, supplier, carrier, or guarantor of any physical products listed by merchants. All transaction disputes, refunds, and delivery promises are between the merchant and the customer.
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. Merchant Obligations & Taxes -->
        <section id="merchant-duties" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">6.</span> Merchant Obligations & Taxes
          </h2>
          <p>
            As a merchant on zlik, you agree to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5550]">
            <li>Accurately describe products, pricing, stock levels, delivery fees, and estimated fulfillment times.</li>
            <li>Honor order commitments and fulfill paid orders in a timely, professional manner.</li>
            <li>Comply with all consumer protection regulations, return policies, and consumer rights.</li>
            <li>Calculate, collect, report, and remit all applicable federal, state, and local taxes (including Nigerian VAT where applicable) resulting from your sales.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 7. Intellectual Property Rights -->
        <section id="intellectual-property" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">7.</span> Intellectual Property Rights
          </h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Platform IP:</strong> All code, design templates, trademarks, graphics, UI components, and software powering zlik are the exclusive intellectual property of zlik and its licensors.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Merchant Content:</strong> You retain ownership of all images, logos, copy, and product details you upload to your store. By uploading content, you grant zlik a non-exclusive license to host, display, resize, and feature your store in the public marketplace directory.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 8. Account Termination & Bans -->
        <section id="suspension" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">8.</span> Account Suspension & Termination
          </h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to suspend, restrict, or terminate any merchant account or store link immediately if we suspect or determine that:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A5550]">
            <li>The merchant has engaged in fraudulent conduct, deceptive sales, or non-fulfillment of paid orders.</li>
            <li>The store lists prohibited items or infringes upon third-party intellectual property.</li>
            <li>The merchant violates these Terms, Nigerian law, or engages in abuse against customers or platform infrastructure.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 9. Limitation of Liability -->
        <section id="disclaimers" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">9.</span> Limitation of Liability & Disclaimers
          </h2>
          <p>
            THE PLATFORM IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, ZLIK SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, GOODWILL, OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE PLATFORM.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 10. Governing Law -->
        <section id="governing-law" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">10.</span> Governing Law & Dispute Resolution
          </h2>
          <p>
            These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the <strong>Federal Republic of Nigeria</strong>. Any dispute, claim, or controversy arising out of or relating to these Terms shall first be attempted to be resolved through good-faith negotiation, and failing that, submitted to the competent courts of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 11. Contact Information -->
        <section id="contact" class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#E3E9E5]">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-[#08110D] tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[#19D98B]">11.</span> Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, inquiries, or concerns regarding these Terms of Service, please contact our team:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#F8FAF8] border border-[#E3E9E5] p-4 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1">
            <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@zlik.store" class="text-[#087A50] font-semibold">legal@zlik.store</a> / <a href="mailto:support@zlik.store" class="text-[#087A50] font-semibold">support@zlik.store</a></div>
            <div><strong>Platform:</strong> zlik (Selling, Made Slick)</div>
            <div><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://zlik.store" class="text-[#087A50] font-semibold">https://zlik.store</a></div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Uniform Public Site Footer -->
